an><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-da137eaf4d73a3f6END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6145740546b906bfEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Cazador'sPalace_DufaysDiary</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Cazador%27sPalace_DufaysDiary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Cazador%27sPalace_DufaysDiary\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">99550741-706c-4384-bce8-64769d22c6be</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:99550741-706c-4384-bce8-64769d22c6be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:99550741-706c-4384-bce8-64769d22c6be\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace#Chamberlain's_Suite\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Chamberlain Suite</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1295&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1000</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Diary of Antwun Dufay, Chamberlain of Cazador's Palace\n</p><p><br>\n[The final page of the diary reads]\n</p><p>I know enough about what the <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cazador\">master</a> has in mind with his ritual that I refuse to be the stand-in for that missing brat <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>. Even if Cazador finds my body, <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Elixir\" title=\"Mysterious Elixir\">the potion</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak%27s_Apothecary\" title=\"Bonecloak's Apothecary\">Bonecloak's</a> sold me is promised to provide a convincing illusion of death - especially since I'll leave behind a lookalike potion of acid poison.\n</p><p><br>\nMy one regret is dear <a href=\"/wiki/Lurianna_Sauvage\" title=\"Lurianna Sauvage\">Lurianna</a> - but I simply cannot trust her with the secret of my one chance of escape. When the potion wears off, Cazador will have Ascended and will have need of my services - or he will be no more, and mastery of the place will fall to me.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202215\nCache expi